    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Făcĕlīnus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phac-</span></b> ), a,
		um, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Făcĕ-lītis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phac-</span></b> ), or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Fascĕlis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phasc-</span></b> ), ĭdis, f.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάκελος</span>, a bundle of
		fagots, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the Taurian Diana</i>: 
